---
import Site from '../layouts/Site.astro';
import Button from '../components/Button.astro';
import SolutionCard from '../components/SolutionCard.astro';
import {url} from '../lib/paths';
---
<Site><section class="hero" aria-labelledby="hero-heading"><img class="hero-image" src={url('images/moraine-lake-1600.webp')} srcset={`${url('images/moraine-lake-640.webp')} 640w, ${url('images/moraine-lake-1024.webp')} 1024w, ${url('images/moraine-lake-1600.webp')} 1600w, ${url('images/moraine-lake-2000.webp')} 2000w`} sizes="100vw" alt="" width="2000" height="1500" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"/><div class="hero-overlay"></div><div class="container hero-content"><p class="eyebrow">FOR THE JOURNEY. AND EVERYTHING AFTER.</p><h1 id="hero-heading">Adventure Awaits.<br/><em>Be Ready for It.</em></h1><p class="hero-copy">From family vacations to wilderness exploration, discover a smarter way to plan, navigate, and prepare for the unexpected.</p><div class="hero-actions"><Button href="#solutions">Find your path</Button><a class="light-link" href={url('how-it-works/')}>Discover the vision <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div></div><div class="container hero-bottom"><span>YOUR NEXT CHAPTER STARTS OUTSIDE.</span><span>MORAINE LAKE / CANADIAN ROCKIES</span></div></section>
<section id="solutions" class="section"><div class="container"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">ONE WORLD. FOUR WAYS FORWARD.</p><h2>Find your kind<br/>of adventure.</h2></div><p>Different journeys. A shared purpose.<br/>Explore the direction Ledovia is taking<br/>for people, places, and the unexpected.</p></div><div class="solution-grid"><SolutionCard number="01 /" title="Travel & Family" text="From the open road to your next port of call. Make room for discovery, together." path="solutions/travel/" status="In development"/><SolutionCard number="02 /" title="Outdoors & Exploration" text="Follow your curiosity, from winding trailheads to nights under the stars." path="solutions/outdoors/" status="In development"/><SolutionCard number="03 /" title="Disaster Response Services" text="A future direction for field documentation, recovery, and coordinated response." path="solutions/response/" status="Planned"/><SolutionCard number="04 /" title="Government & Agencies" text="A future direction for operational mapping and shared situational awareness." path="solutions/government/" status="Planned"/></div></div></section>
<section class="section technology"><div class="container split"><div class="map-art" role="img" aria-label="Illustrative map concept with a dotted route. Not a working product."><div class="contours"></div><span class="map-label">LEDOVIA / FIELD NOTES</span><svg viewBox="0 0 420 260" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M55 220Q85 70 180 145T355 40" stroke="#EDAA43" stroke-width="3" stroke-dasharray="6 10" fill="none"/><circle cx="55" cy="220" r="6" fill="#EDAA43"/><circle cx="355" cy="40" r="9" fill="#EDAA43"/></svg><span class="map-caption">A little direction. A world of possibility.<small>Illustrative concept · Not a product screen</small></span></div><div><p class="eyebrow">PURPOSEFUL BY DESIGN</p><h2>Technology that<br/>travels with you.</h2><p>Our vision brings trip planning, saved places, offline maps, and preparedness resources into a more connected journey.</p><p class="muted">These capabilities are in development. Availability, supported regions, and offline behavior have not been verified here.</p><a class="inline-link" href={url('how-it-works/')}>Explore the vision <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="container prepared"><p class="eyebrow">CONFIDENCE BEGINS WITH PREPARATION</p><h2>Leave room for wonder.<br/>Plan for the unexpected.</h2><p>Check conditions. Know your route. Carry the essentials.<br/>Good preparation is part of every great adventure.</p><p class="fine">Ledovia’s planned resources complement personal preparation.<br/>Always follow official guidance and use appropriate emergency services.</p></div></section>
<section class="development"><div class="container status-row"><div><p class="eyebrow">BUILDING WITH INTENTION</p><h2>A clear view of what’s next.</h2></div><p>This is our initial Beta website foundation. Travel and outdoor experiences are <strong>in development</strong>. Professional response and agency capabilities are <strong>planned</strong>. No operational capabilities are offered here.</p></div></section>
<section class="section final-cta"><div class="container"><p class="eyebrow">WHERE WILL YOU GO NEXT?</p><h2>Ready for the Adventure.<br/><em>Prepared for the Unexpected.</em></h2><Button href={url('contact/')}>Connect with Ledovia</Button><p class="fine">Contact information is coming soon.</p></div></section></Site>
